@page
@model AboutModel

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <h1>About Gifters</h1>
    <p class="lead">
        Gifters is a disaster-relief platform designed to connect
        people who want to help with communities affected by disasters.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-4">Our Mission</h2>

    <p>
        Our mission is to make it easier for people to contribute to
        disaster-relief efforts through donations and volunteering.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-4">How We Help</h2>

    <p>
        Gifters provides a central platform where supporters can learn
        about relief efforts, make donations, and register their interest
        in volunteering.
    </p>

    <p>
        By bringing these activities together, the platform aims to make
        disaster-relief support more accessible and organised.
    </p>

</div>